(5770183, 839968, 30049, '<td valign="top">I actually had to look up the word ''Regression'' to make sure my understanding of the word is correct.  I''m not sure I understand why you picked that as a title for this photo.  ???<br/> <br/>The photo itself is ok.  Subject is off-center, which is good, and the deck adds interest.  The bending of the tall grass mimics the movements of the kids.  A tad faster shutter speed to freeze the action would be better and maybe a tighter crop/framing of the subject could be a stronger presentation.<br/> <br/>Voted earlier.  Gave it a 6.  Coming back around to comment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I actually had to look up the word ''Regression'' to make sure my understanding of the word is correct.  I''m not sure I understand why you picked that as a title for this photo.  ??? The photo itself is ok.  Subject is off-center, which is good, and the deck adds interest.  The bending of the tall grass mimics the movements of the kids.  A tad faster shutter speed to freeze the action would be better and maybe a tighter crop/framing of the subject could be a stronger presentation. Voted earlier.  Gave it a 6.  Coming back around to comment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-12-17 10:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
