(5773275, 839595, 83313, '<td valign="top">You''re really gonna make me think hard about this one. I''ve gotta give you kudos for the sheer cajones displayed here. Oh, heck, it''s gonna get creamed by everyone else, so I''m gonna be generous. Mainly because I appreciate the blatant shoehorn.</td>', 'You''re really gonna make me think hard about this one. I''ve gotta give you kudos for the sheer cajones displayed here. Oh, heck, it''s gonna get creamed by everyone else, so I''m gonna be generous. Mainly because I appreciate the blatant shoehorn.', '2009-12-20 14:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773276, 838566, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if these folks are really enthused about their fishing, It''s probably a dull daily chore for them. It''s a cool looking shot, however.</td>', 'Not sure if these folks are really enthused about their fishing, It''s probably a dull daily chore for them. It''s a cool looking shot, however.', '2009-12-20 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773278, 839719, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now <b>this</b> is a fun shot! Conveys the topic, and visually engaging to boot.</td>', 'Now this is a fun shot! Conveys the topic, and visually engaging to boot.', '2009-12-20 14:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773546, 839011, 67697, '<td valign="top">As much as it pains me to give praise to anything related to Cleveland  :), I have to say this is one of the best shots in the challenge.  People outside of the midwest probably won''t get full appreciation of the Dawg Pound from this shot (was this the -12 degree game?).  I like how he has his name on his hat.  I''m guessing just in case he loses it or it gets mixed in with the other dog bone hats? lol</td>', 'As much as it pains me to give praise to anything related to Cleveland  :), I have to say this is one of the best shots in the challenge.  People outside of the midwest probably won''t get full appreciation of the Dawg Pound from this shot (was this the -12 degree game?).  I like how he has his name on his hat.  I''m guessing just in case he loses it or it gets mixed in with the other dog bone hats? lol', '2009-12-20 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773547, 840057, 67697, '<td valign="top">If Mom is lucky, this enthusiasm will fade in a year, like it did in our house lol.  Very cute shot.</td>', 'If Mom is lucky, this enthusiasm will fade in a year, like it did in our house lol.  Very cute shot.', '2009-12-20 21:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773548, 839960, 67697, '<td valign="top">So gross lol.  I''m such a city girl.  Love the one that is "hamming" it up for you hehehe</td>', 'So gross lol.  I''m such a city girl.  Love the one that is "hamming" it up for you hehehe', '2009-12-20 22:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773549, 839888, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how you framed mom in the picture.  Great capture with him in mid-air.</td>', 'I love how you framed mom in the picture.  Great capture with him in mid-air.', '2009-12-20 22:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773550, 838992, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cute candid.  I can''t get over how red the boy''s ears are!</td>', 'Cute candid.  I can''t get over how red the boy''s ears are!', '2009-12-20 22:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773553, 839770, 67697, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  Love the colortone.</td>', 'Fun shot.  Love the colortone.', '2009-12-20 22:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773554, 839890, 67697, '<td valign="top">Clever that the word "fly" is on her shirt.  This is the best kind of trampoline for sure :)</td>', 'Clever that the word "fly" is on her shirt.  This is the best kind of trampoline for sure :)', '2009-12-20 22:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773568, 839421, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Love the clarity on the little one although it would be nice if the oof object on the right was not there.</td>', 'Very cute.  Love the clarity on the little one although it would be nice if the oof object on the right was not there.', '2009-12-20 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773570, 839867, 67697, '<td valign="top">Interesting - what is he working on?  Love how he looks so engrossed in completing his project.</td>', 'Interesting - what is he working on?  Love how he looks so engrossed in completing his project.', '2009-12-20 22:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773573, 839827, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s weird that this would need to be validated. This looks like it must have been a very fun wedding.  Love the enthusiasm in this.</td>', 'It''s weird that this would need to be validated. This looks like it must have been a very fun wedding.  Love the enthusiasm in this.', '2009-12-20 22:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773578, 839437, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming that is a monitor or poster in the background.  I am not sure I understand the combo of the two items.  I''m reading the title, but I''m thinking that you could have used something else besides the vortex?  A woody doll maybe?  hehe</td>', 'I''m assuming that is a monitor or poster in the background.  I am not sure I understand the combo of the two items.  I''m reading the title, but I''m thinking that you could have used something else besides the vortex?  A woody doll maybe?  hehe', '2009-12-20 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773580, 838638, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Love how the one kid''s got his shirt all twisted up.</td>', 'Cute.  Love how the one kid''s got his shirt all twisted up.', '2009-12-20 22:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773585, 839980, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  For this challenge, it would have been better if they were all looking at you.  You did capture a good hamball moment tho.</td>', 'Cute idea.  For this challenge, it would have been better if they were all looking at you.  You did capture a good hamball moment tho.', '2009-12-20 22:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773589, 838572, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture - I love the sky.  I''m sure it''s very exciting to watch as your new home is being built.  But I''m giving this a 5 because the picture is not really conveying a sense of enthusiasm to me.  I''m just not feeling the emotion.  Anywho, good luck with your new home!</td>', 'This is a great picture - I love the sky.  I''m sure it''s very exciting to watch as your new home is being built.  But I''m giving this a 5 because the picture is not really conveying a sense of enthusiasm to me.  I''m just not feeling the emotion.  Anywho, good luck with your new home!', '2009-12-20 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773590, 839595, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sarcastic enthusiasm!  Awesome!</td>', 'Sarcastic enthusiasm!  Awesome!', '2009-12-20 22:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773599, 840002, 67697, '<td valign="top">love the flying ears on the black dog</td>', 'love the flying ears on the black dog', '2009-12-20 23:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773892, 839888, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  Kid jumping is great and having mom in the background that follows the form of the kid is perfect.  Wonder if you planned this (taking many shots) or if this was serendipitous.  Like the entire composition on the bridge with the patterns of the railing and the light posts.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'I like the composition.  Kid jumping is great and having mom in the background that follows the form of the kid is perfect.  Wonder if you planned this (taking many shots) or if this was serendipitous.  Like the entire composition on the bridge with the patterns of the railing and the light posts.  One of my favorites.', '2009-12-21 01:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773896, 839827, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The left three riders definitely show enthusiasm.  I like the "action" of the shot, the stride of the horses and the "tension" of the riders.  I think this should do well.</td>', 'Great shot.  The left three riders definitely show enthusiasm.  I like the "action" of the shot, the stride of the horses and the "tension" of the riders.  I think this should do well.', '2009-12-21 01:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5773944, 840007, 108580, '<td valign="top">Excellent studio shot, lighting, focus, comp. Great expression. Meets challenge. Top 3 imo.</td>', 'Excellent studio shot, lighting, focus, comp. Great expression. Meets challenge. Top 3 imo.', '2009-12-21 02:27:09.000000', NULL, 1);
