(5777115, 839770, 105457, '<td valign="top">Great on every account. Good composition, great DOF, and the choice for b&amp;w almost sepia is excellent.<br/>Good job!</td>', 'Great on every account. Good composition, great DOF, and the choice for b&w almost sepia is excellent.Good job!', '2009-12-22 09:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
