(5778623, 839770, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow fantastic shot mate, there is something very Bresson about this which I really really like. He almost looks like he''s coming out of the screen at you. My favourite in this challenge by miles, well done and ''grats on the HM.</td>', 'Wow fantastic shot mate, there is something very Bresson about this which I really really like. He almost looks like he''s coming out of the screen at you. My favourite in this challenge by miles, well done and ''grats on the HM.', '2009-12-23 00:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
