(5778636, 839888, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD on your HM. Definate enthusiasm about something here! The woman in the BG has a smirk on her face so I think she is responsible for his enthusiasm, like he''s just been told he can have that present for Xmas he always wanted.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-23 01:08:55.</i></td>', 'WD on your HM. Definate enthusiasm about something here! The woman in the BG has a smirk on her face so I think she is responsible for his enthusiasm, like he''s just been told he can have that present for Xmas he always wanted.', '2009-12-23 01:07:52.000000', '2009-12-23 01:08:55.000000', 0),
