(5778890, 839002, 105130, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, votes and the the favourite guys! This is an excellent early Christmas present and totally unexpected. It''s gonna take some hard work to beat this result!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, votes and the the favourite guys! This is an excellent early Christmas present and totally unexpected. It''s gonna take some hard work to beat this result!', '2009-12-23 04:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5778897, 838533, 112658, '<td valign="top">Good lord... you people are ruff with your investigations.  Perhaps the time I am off of work, usually 4am, and the time I uploaded the picture didn''t EXACTLY correspond with my computer''s clock and the sites in matching the dates.  <br/> <br/>Or maybe after working 16 hours I mistaked the date from the pervious evening to the actual evening I uploaded the image.<br/> <br/>You nutzito are amazing in your detective and jumping to conclusions abilities.  Get a life.</td>', 'Good lord... you people are ruff with your investigations.  Perhaps the time I am off of work, usually 4am, and the time I uploaded the picture didn''t EXACTLY correspond with my computer''s clock and the sites in matching the dates.   Or maybe after working 16 hours I mistaked the date from the pervious evening to the actual evening I uploaded the image. You nutzito are amazing in your detective and jumping to conclusions abilities.  Get a life.', '2009-12-23 04:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5778910, 839890, 112107, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> Clever that the word "fly" is on her shirt.  This is the best kind of trampoline for sure :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Wasn''t planned! I have to confess I didn''t noticed it until you mentioned.:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-23 05:31:19.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: Clever that the word "fly" is on her shirt.  This is the best kind of trampoline for sure :)  Wasn''t planned! I have to confess I didn''t noticed it until you mentioned.:)', '2009-12-23 05:25:45.000000', '2009-12-23 05:31:19.000000', 0),
(5778915, 839890, 112107, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sarampo:</b></div><hr/><i> Good moment, but a bit blurred, could have used a higher shutter speed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You are absolutely right! I had set the camera on A mode (as I do 95% of the times) and it picked up 1/30s. I really should start thinking more about shutter speed but most of the times for my shooting it isn''t all that relevant. In this case and since flash was used I could have gotten away with a much faster one.</td>', 'Originally posted by sarampo: Good moment, but a bit blurred, could have used a higher shutter speed.  You are absolutely right! I had set the camera on A mode (as I do 95% of the times) and it picked up 1/30s. I really should start thinking more about shutter speed but most of the times for my shooting it isn''t all that relevant. In this case and since flash was used I could have gotten away with a much faster one.', '2009-12-23 05:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5778926, 840057, 25355, '<td valign="top">This one got my top vote, and I almost forgot to vote.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-26 07:16:20.</i></td>', 'This one got my top vote, and I almost forgot to vote.', '2009-12-23 05:57:06.000000', '2009-12-26 07:16:20.000000', 0),
