(5781022, 838533, 67237, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ChapmanStapleford:</b></div><hr/><i> Good lord... you people are ruff with your investigations.  Perhaps the time I am off of work, usually 4am, and the time I uploaded the picture didn''t EXACTLY correspond with my computer''s clock and the sites in matching the dates.  <br/> <br/>Or maybe after working 16 hours I mistaked the date from the pervious evening to the actual evening I uploaded the image.<br/> <br/>You nutzito are amazing in your detective and jumping to conclusions abilities.  Get a life. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Christopher, I apologize if my comment bothered you. It was not meant to jump to any conclusion, it was only an statistical perspective with no offense. Keep up taking great pictures. I will get a life and you promise me you will not work 16hrs a day :-). Merry Christmas.</td>', 'Originally posted by ChapmanStapleford: Good lord... you people are ruff with your investigations.  Perhaps the time I am off of work, usually 4am, and the time I uploaded the picture didn''t EXACTLY correspond with my computer''s clock and the sites in matching the dates.   Or maybe after working 16 hours I mistaked the date from the pervious evening to the actual evening I uploaded the image. You nutzito are amazing in your detective and jumping to conclusions abilities.  Get a life.   Christopher, I apologize if my comment bothered you. It was not meant to jump to any conclusion, it was only an statistical perspective with no offense. Keep up taking great pictures. I will get a life and you promise me you will not work 16hrs a day :-). Merry Christmas.', '2009-12-25 14:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
